Package: predictVoterIdeologyR
Type: Package
Title: Fast Soft-Vote Predictions for Voter Ideology Models (scikit-learn Random Forests)
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Philipp Mellacher
Maintainer: Philipp Mellacher <you@example.com>
Description: 
  Provides a fast, pure-R implementation of scikit-learn RandomForest
  soft-vote predictions from JSON exports (including StandardScaler parameters).
  Includes helpers to add three ideology predictions (lrgen, lrecon, galtan)
  to a data frame. Parallel tree evaluation supported on Windows.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    jsonlite,
    parallel
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
